tcode, that it encounters. This preserved accoutcode will be used to set the CDR(accountcode) for any outbound calls that result from any type of redirected call (CF, VmX, Follow-Me, etc.). The account code for each user is pulled out of their associated device settings, which means this is only supported in extension mode and would have to be updated for deviceanduser mode, requiring a new accountcode field to be defined for the user on the extension\\/user screen.\\n\\t\",\"changelog\":\"\\n\\t\\t*16.0.0.1* Initial Release\\n\\t\",\"supported\":{\"version\":\"16.0\"},\"location\":\"packages\\/accountcodepreserve\\/accountcodepreserve-16.0.0.1.tgz.gpg\",\"md5sum\":\"ce535db8cd9a07c85262c9d595ea459e\",\"signed\":{\"type\":\"gpg\",\"sha1\":\"62a50a441b77ce7c86f92ec4e01e9e2612e3469f\"},\"sha1\":\"2f3084e9a124aa9553d16e0ccb63a29c0da79d51\",\"packaged\":\"1617187400\"},\"adv_recovery\":{\"rawname\":\"adv_recovery\",\"name\":\"Advanced Recovery\",\"version\":\"16.0.43.15\",\"publisher\":\"Sangoma Technologies Corporation\",\"license\":\"Commercial\",\"licenselink\":\"https:\\/\\/portal.sangoma.com\\/marketing\\/resources\\/2808\\/Sangoma%20Corporate\\/Terms%20of%20Service%20and%20User%20License%20Agreement\\/FreePBXCommercialModule-EndUserAgreement.txt\",\"repo\":\"commercial\",\"commercial\":{\"type\":\"paid\",\"link\":\"\\/\\/www.freepbx.org\\/add-ons\\/#advanced-recovery\"},\"category\":\"Admin\",\"description\":\"COMMERCIAL MODULE, REQUIRES A LICENSE. Advanced Recovery makes it easy to setup a warm spare that can easily take over if your primary server fails.\",\"more-info\":\"https:\\/\\/wiki.freepbx.org\\/display\\/FPG\\/Advanced+Recovery\",\"depends\":{\"module\":[\"filestore ge 16.0.10.7\",\"api ge 16.0.4.8\",\"backup ge 16.0.50.8\",\"endpoint ge 16.0.59.34\"],\"version\":\"16.0.10.27\",\"phpcomponent\":\"ionCube PHP Loader\",\"phpversion\":\"7.4\"},\"supported\":{\"supported\":[{\"version\":\"16.0\"},{\"version\":\"16.0\"}]},\"changelog\":\"\\n\\t\\t*16.0.43.15*